.page tac 1 write lines in reverse order

# SYNOPSIS
*tac* [_FILE_...]

# DESCRIPTION
`tac` (`cat` backwards) writes the lines of each input, last line first. The whole input is read before anything is written. Standard input is used when no file is given.

# EXAMPLES
    tac /Hakurei/etc/group
    seq 1 5 | tac

# SEE ALSO
cat(1), rev(1), sort(1)
